            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;Your feedbacks were locked successfully. You can click on the Customer Feedback-&amp;gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;Your Feedback&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt; listview to check the same.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
